  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Panoramic Data's EPPlus Free Edition\n\t\t\t# LGPL License continue\n\t\t\t11.0 - BREAKING. Full details: https://github.com/panoramicdata/PanoramicData.EPPlus/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n\t\t\tTargets .NET 11 (net11.0).\n\t\t\tSystem.Drawing.Common (GDI+) is no longer used: the Image and Font based members are replaced by byte[] and Stream overloads, and AutoFitColumns measures text with SkiaSharp.\n\t\t\tThe bundled DotNetZip code is removed and packages are read and written with System.IO.Compression. The 22 public types in OfficeOpenXml.Packaging.DotNetZip and OfficeOpenXml.Packaging.DotNetZip.Zlib are gone; use System.IO.Compression instead. Zip64 is still used only when a workbook needs it.\n\t\t\tSome methods in Drawing, Style and ConditionalFormatting now throw InvalidOperationException or ArgumentException instead of System.Exception, with the same messages.\n\t\t\tdouble to decimal conversions keep the .NET 10 rounding to 15 significant digits on .NET 11.",
